exports[`host CLI commands > install, doctor, and uninstall vscode-copilot 1`] = `
"$ tokenjuice doctor vscode-copilot
[stdout] hooks path: <SANDBOX>/home/.copilot/hooks/tokenjuice-vscode.json
[stdout] health: disabled
[stdout] expected command: <NODE> '<LAUNCHER>' vscode-copilot-pre-tool-use --wrap-launcher '<LAUNCHER>'
[stdout] advisories:
[stdout] - enable \`chat.useHooks\` in VS Code settings and trust the workspace; both are required for the hook to fire.
[stdout] - paste the snippet from \`tokenjuice doctor vscode-copilot --print-instructions\` into \`.github/copilot-instructions.md\` or \`AGENTS.md\` so the agent respects compacted output and knows when to prefix a command with \`tokenjuice wrap --raw --\`.
